stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> Idle

  Idle --> Entering: digit or Decimal point
  Idle --> OperatorPending: operator key
  Entering --> Entering: digit, Decimal point, Negate, Backspace
  Entering --> OperatorPending: operator key
  OperatorPending --> OperatorPending: another operator replaces it
  OperatorPending --> Entering: digit

  Entering --> Awaiting: Equals, unary key, Memory add or subtract
  Entering --> Awaiting: operator key after left, operator and right
  ShowingResult --> Awaiting: Equals repeats, unary key, Memory add or subtract
  OperatorPending --> Awaiting: Equals

  Awaiting --> ShowingResult: 200 from the API
  Awaiting --> OperatorPending: 200 after a chained operator
  Awaiting --> Error: problem, network failure or odd response

  ShowingResult --> Entering: digit or Decimal point
  ShowingResult --> OperatorPending: operator key
  Error --> Entering: digit or Decimal point clears the alert

  state "Awaiting API response" as Awaiting

  note right of Awaiting
    aria-busy is true and key presses are ignored.
    Only the API computes numbers.
  end note

  note left of Error
    Display reads Error and ErrorBanner holds the detail.
    Only digits, Decimal point, All clear, Backspace
    and Memory clear act. All clear returns to Idle.
  end note

  note right of Idle
    All clear returns to Idle from any state and keeps memory.
    Components: App holds Display, Keypad with its Keys,
    HistoryPanel and ErrorBanner.
    The reducer is pure. useCalculator sends its requests.
  end note
